- driver_advocate#claim (driver_advocate): The driver arrived two minutes early, stayed at the pickup point through the full free-wait and no-show window, and tried to reach the rider by message and call.
- driver_advocate#counter-1 (driver_advocate): The rider says the driver was not there.

